  "text": "TASK_095 Completion Notes:\n\n**Files Modified:**\n- src/lib/code-review/types.ts - Added 'codex' to union\n- src/lib/code-review/codex.ts - New Codex integration (146 lines)\n- src/lib/code-review/index.ts - Wired in Codex option\n- src/lib/code-review/codex.test.ts - Full test coverage (239 lines)\n- src/commands/prepare-completion.ts - Timeout display logic\n- src/lib/config.ts - Type definitions (CRITICAL - caught by Codex)\n- .claude/track.config.json - Updated description and tested with codex\n\n**Pattern Established:**\nThe temp file approach for large CLI prompts is now documented and could be reused for other CLI tool integrations. Key elements:\n1. Write content to tmpdir() with unique filename\n2. Use command substitution in execSync\n3. Clean up in finally block\n4. Handle errors gracefully\n\n**Testing Coverage:**\n6 comprehensive tests covering all scenarios - this followed the established pattern from coderabbit.test.ts perfectly.",
